  "ruleText": "Frl 701.03 Exception. A stand-alone chapel of a funeral establishment, with the same ownership, shall be permitted to operate without maintaining a preparation room.\n\nSource. #9716, eff 5-17-10; ss by #12673, eff 11-20-18",
